-- DEMO-only ACL parity for shared SECURITY DEFINER functions.
-- This list was generated by comparing effective anon/authenticated EXECUTE grants in DEMO
-- with the current LIVE project's grants. LIVE was queried read-only and was not changed.
-- Revoke inherited PUBLIC grants, then restore only the exact anon/authenticated grants
-- present in LIVE. Preserve existing service_role access for these shared functions.
-- Never apply this file to LIVE.

